{"seq":2,"slug":"storybook-documentation","title":"Storybook 组件文档化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems/patterns/storybook-documentation","wordCount":641,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"storybook-组件文档化\">Storybook 组件文档化</h1><p>设计系统的价值不仅在于组件的代码质量，更在于消费方能否快速理解并正确使用它们。Storybook 8 已成为组件文档化的行业标准——它将交互式演示、API 文档、可视化测试和无障碍检查统一到单一开发环境中，成为设计系统的&quot;活文档&quot;平台。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Storybook 的核心理念是&quot;组件驱动开发&quot;（Component-Driven Development）——在独立于应用的隔离环境中开发、测试和文档化每个组件。一个 Story 就是组件在特定 props/state 下的一个渲染快照。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph Storybook 生态&#10;        CSF[Component Story Format] --&gt; STORY[Stories .stories.tsx]&#10;        MDX[MDX 文档] --&gt; DOC[Documentation Pages]&#10;        STORY --&gt; SB[Storybook UI]&#10;        DOC --&gt; SB&#10;        SB --&gt; VR[Visual Regression Testing]&#10;        SB --&gt; A11Y[Accessibility Audit]&#10;        SB --&gt; INT[Interaction Testing]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 消费方&#10;        SB --&gt; DEV[开发者查阅]&#10;        SB --&gt; DES[设计师验证]&#10;        SB --&gt; QA[QA 回归检查]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph Storybook 生态\n        CSF[Component Story Format] --&gt; STORY[Stories .stories.tsx]\n        MDX[MDX 文档] --&gt; DOC[Documentation Pages]\n        STORY --&gt; SB[Storybook UI]\n        DOC --&gt; SB\n        SB --&gt; VR[Visual Regression Testing]\n        SB --&gt; A11Y[Accessibility Audit]\n        SB --&gt; INT[Interaction Testing]\n    end\n    subgraph 消费方\n        SB --&gt; DEV[开发者查阅]\n        SB --&gt; DES[设计师验证]\n        SB --&gt; QA[QA 回归检查]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Storybook 能力</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>适用角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>交互式演示</td>\n<td>实时调整 Props 观察效果</td>\n<td>开发者、设计师</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Autodocs</td>\n<td>从 TypeScript 类型自动生成 API 文档</td>\n<td>开发者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MDX 文档</td>\n<td>Markdown + JSX 混合编写深度文档</td>\n<td>技术写作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Visual Tests</td>\n<td>像素级截图对比发现视觉回归</td>\n<td>QA、CI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Interaction Tests</td>\n<td>play function 模拟用户交互</td>\n<td>QA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Accessibility</td>\n<td>集成 axe-core 实时检查 WCAG</td>\n<td>全员</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"component-story-format-csf-3\">Component Story Format（CSF 3）</h2><p>CSF 3 是 Storybook 8 的标准编写格式。每个 story 文件导出一个 meta 配置和多个具名 Story：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import type { Meta, StoryObj } from &#39;@storybook/react&#39;;&#10;import { Button } from &#39;./Button&#39;;&#10;&#10;const meta = {&#10;  component: Button,&#10;  title: &#39;Components/Button&#39;,&#10;  tags: [&#39;autodocs&#39;],&#10;  argTypes: {&#10;    variant: {&#10;      control: &#39;select&#39;,&#10;      options: [&#39;default&#39;, &#39;secondary&#39;, &#39;outline&#39;, &#39;ghost&#39;, &#39;destructive&#39;],&#10;      description: &#39;按钮视觉变体&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;    size: {&#10;      control: &#39;radio&#39;,&#10;      options: [&#39;sm&#39;, &#39;default&#39;, &#39;lg&#39;, &#39;icon&#39;],&#10;    },&#10;    disabled: { control: &#39;boolean&#39; },&#10;    loading: { control: &#39;boolean&#39; },&#10;  },&#10;  args: {&#10;    children: &#39;按钮文本&#39;,&#10;    variant: &#39;default&#39;,&#10;    size: &#39;default&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;} satisfies Meta&lt;typeof Button&gt;;&#10;&#10;export default meta;&#10;type Story = StoryObj&lt;typeof meta&gt;;&#10;&#10;export const Default: Story = {};&#10;&#10;export const Secondary: Story = {&#10;  args: { variant: &#39;secondary&#39; },&#10;};&#10;&#10;export const Destructive: Story = {&#10;  args: { variant: &#39;destructive&#39;, children: &#39;删除&#39; },&#10;};&#10;&#10;export const Loading: Story = {&#10;  args: { loading: true, children: &#39;提交中...&#39; },&#10;};&#10;&#10;export const AllSizes: Story = {&#10;  render: (args) =&gt; (&#10;    &lt;div className=&quot;flex items-center gap-4&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;Button {...args} size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;&#10;        Small&#10;      &lt;/Button&gt;&#10;      &lt;Button {...args} size=&quot;default&quot;&gt;&#10;        Default&#10;      &lt;/Button&gt;&#10;      &lt;Button {...args} size=&quot;lg&quot;&gt;&#10;        Large&#10;      &lt;/Button&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  ),&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import type { Meta, StoryObj } from '@storybook/react';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { Button } from './Button';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const meta = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  component: Button,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  title: 'Components/Button',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  tags: ['autodocs'],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  argTypes: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    variant: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      control: 'select',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      options: ['default', 'secondary', 'outline', 'ghost', 'destructive'],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      description: '按钮视觉变体',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    size: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      control: 'radio',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      options: ['sm', 'default', 'lg', 'icon'],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    disabled: { control: 'boolean' },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    loading: { control: 'boolean' },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  args: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    children: '按钮文本',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    variant: 'default',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    size: 'default',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>} satisfies Meta&#x3C;typeof Button>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export default meta;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type Story = StoryObj&#x3C;typeof meta>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export const Default: Story = {};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export const Secondary: Story = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  args: { variant: 'secondary' },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export const Destructive: Story = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  args: { variant: 'destructive', children: '删除' },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export const Loading: Story = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  args: { loading: true, children: '提交中...' },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export const AllSizes: Story = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  render: (args) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div className=\"flex items-center gap-4\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Button {...args} size=\"sm\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Small</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/Button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Button {...args} size=\"default\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Default</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/Button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Button {...args} size=\"lg\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Large</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/Button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"autodocs-自动文档生成\">Autodocs 自动文档生成</h2><p>Storybook 8 的 Autodocs 从 TypeScript 类型定义自动生成完整的 API 文档页面：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"// 在 .storybook/preview.ts 全局启用&#10;const preview: Preview = {&#10;  tags: [&#39;autodocs&#39;],&#10;};&#10;export default preview;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 在 .storybook/preview.ts 全局启用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const preview: Preview = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  tags: ['autodocs'],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export default preview;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>启用后，Storybook 自动为每个组件生成：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Props 表格（类型、默认值、描述——从 TSDoc/JSDoc 提取）</li>\n<li>所有 Story 的交互式渲染</li>\n<li>Controls 面板允许实时修改 props</li>\n</ul>\n<p>为获得最佳文档质量，组件 props 应有完整的 TSDoc：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"interface ButtonProps {&#10;  /** 按钮视觉变体 */&#10;  variant?: &#39;default&#39; | &#39;secondary&#39; | &#39;outline&#39; | &#39;ghost&#39; | &#39;destructive&#39;;&#10;  /** 按钮尺寸 */&#10;  size?: &#39;sm&#39; | &#39;default&#39; | &#39;lg&#39; | &#39;icon&#39;;&#10;  /** 是否禁用交互 */&#10;  disabled?: boolean;&#10;  /** 显示加载状态，同时禁用交互 */&#10;  loading?: boolean;&#10;  /** 使用子元素作为渲染根节点 */&#10;  asChild?: boolean;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>interface ButtonProps {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  /** 按钮视觉变体 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  variant?: 'default' | 'secondary' | 'outline' | 'ghost' | 'destructive';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  /** 按钮尺寸 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  size?: 'sm' | 'default' | 'lg' | 'icon';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  /** 是否禁用交互 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  disabled?: boolean;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  /** 显示加载状态，同时禁用交互 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  loading?: boolean;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  /** 使用子元素作为渲染根节点 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  asChild?: boolean;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"mdx-深度文档\">MDX 深度文档</h2><p>对于需要丰富叙述性内容的场景（设计指南、用法最佳实践），MDX 格式支持在 Markdown 中嵌入 Story 渲染：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"mdx\" data-code=\"import { Meta, Canvas, Controls } from &#39;@storybook/blocks&#39;;&#10;import * as ButtonStories from &#39;./Button.stories&#39;;&#10;&#10;&lt;Meta of={ButtonStories} /&gt;&#10;&#10;# Button 使用指南&#10;&#10;Button 是设计系统中最基础的交互元素。选择正确的变体对用户体验至关重要。&#10;&#10;## 变体选择指南&#10;&#10;| 场景     | 推荐变体            | 原因               |&#10;| -------- | ------------------- | ------------------ |&#10;| 主要操作 | default             | 视觉权重最高       |&#10;| 次要操作 | secondary / outline | 不抢夺主操作注意力 |&#10;| 危险操作 | destructive         | 红色警示           |&#10;| 内嵌操作 | ghost               | 最小视觉干扰       |&#10;&#10;## 交互演示&#10;&#10;&lt;Canvas of={ButtonStories.Default} /&gt;&#10;&lt;Controls of={ButtonStories.Default} /&gt;&#10;&#10;## 无障碍要求&#10;&#10;- 始终提供可识别的文本内容（不要只用图标无 label）&#10;- `disabled` 状态仍需保持在 Tab 序列中（aria-disabled）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { Meta, Canvas, Controls } from '@storybook/blocks';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import * as ButtonStories from './Button.stories';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;Meta of={ButtonStories} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># Button 使用指南</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Button 是设计系统中最基础的交互元素。选择正确的变体对用户体验至关重要。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>## 变体选择指南</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>| 场景     | 推荐变体            | 原因               |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>| -------- | ------------------- | ------------------ |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>| 主要操作 | default             | 视觉权重最高       |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>| 次要操作 | secondary / outline | 不抢夺主操作注意力 |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>| 危险操作 | destructive         | 红色警示           |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>| 内嵌操作 | ghost               | 最小视觉干扰       |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>## 交互演示</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;Canvas of={ButtonStories.Default} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;Controls of={ButtonStories.Default} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>## 无障碍要求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 始终提供可识别的文本内容（不要只用图标无 label）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- `disabled` 状态仍需保持在 Tab 序列中（aria-disabled）</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"storybook-与-ci-的集成\">Storybook 与 CI 的集成</h2><p>Storybook 在 CI 中的三个核心用途：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    PR[Pull Request] --&gt; BUILD[Storybook Build]&#10;    BUILD --&gt; DEPLOY[发布预览 URL]&#10;    BUILD --&gt; VRT[Visual Regression Test]&#10;    BUILD --&gt; A11Y[Accessibility Scan]&#10;    DEPLOY --&gt; REVIEW[设计师/PM 评审]&#10;    VRT --&gt; PASS{通过?}&#10;    A11Y --&gt; PASS&#10;    PASS --&gt;|是| MERGE[允许合并]&#10;    PASS --&gt;|否| FIX[修复后重新提交]\">graph LR\n    PR[Pull Request] --&gt; BUILD[Storybook Build]\n    BUILD --&gt; DEPLOY[发布预览 URL]\n    BUILD --&gt; VRT[Visual Regression Test]\n    BUILD --&gt; A11Y[Accessibility Scan]\n    DEPLOY --&gt; REVIEW[设计师/PM 评审]\n    VRT --&gt; PASS{通过?}\n    A11Y --&gt; PASS\n    PASS --&gt;|是| MERGE[允许合并]\n    PASS --&gt;|否| FIX[修复后重新提交]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>CI 检查</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>检查内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Visual Regression</td>\n<td>Chromatic / Percy</td>\n<td>像素级截图对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Accessibility</td>\n<td>@storybook/addon-a11y</td>\n<td>axe-core WCAG 规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Interaction</td>\n<td>@storybook/test</td>\n<td>play function 行为断言</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Build</td>\n<td>storybook build</td>\n<td>确保文档站可正常构建</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"interaction-testing-与-play-functions\">Interaction Testing 与 Play Functions</h2><p>Storybook 8 内置的交互测试通过 <code>play</code> 函数模拟用户行为并做断言：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { expect, userEvent, within } from &#39;@storybook/test&#39;;&#10;&#10;export const FormSubmission: Story = {&#10;  play: async ({ canvasElement }) =&gt; {&#10;    const canvas = within(canvasElement);&#10;&#10;    await userEvent.type(canvas.getByLabelText(&#39;邮箱&#39;), &#39;test@example.com&#39;);&#10;    await userEvent.type(canvas.getByLabelText(&#39;密码&#39;), &#39;password123&#39;);&#10;    await userEvent.click(canvas.getByRole(&#39;button&#39;, { name: &#39;登录&#39; }));&#10;&#10;    await expect(canvas.getByText(&#39;登录成功&#39;)).toBeInTheDocument();&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { expect, userEvent, within } from '@storybook/test';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export const FormSubmission: Story = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  play: async ({ canvasElement }) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const canvas = within(canvasElement);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await userEvent.type(canvas.getByLabelText('邮箱'), 'test@example.com');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await userEvent.type(canvas.getByLabelText('密码'), 'password123');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await userEvent.click(canvas.getByRole('button', { name: '登录' }));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await expect(canvas.getByText('登录成功')).toBeInTheDocument();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Storybook 8 是设计系统活文档的行业标准平台</li>\n<li>CSF 3 格式通过 <code>satisfies Meta</code> 实现完整类型安全</li>\n<li>Autodocs 从 TypeScript 类型自动生成 API 参考文档</li>\n<li>MDX 支持在叙述性文档中嵌入交互式 Story 演示</li>\n<li>CI 集成覆盖 Visual Regression、Accessibility、Interaction 三重检查</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"code-distribution-registry\">代码分发与 Registry 模式</a> — 组件分发后的文档化需求</li>\n<li><a href=\"component-testing\">组件视觉与行为测试</a> — Storybook 测试能力的深入展开</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../web-accessibility-implementation-testing/implementation/keyboard-navigation-focus\">键盘导航与焦点管理</a> — Storybook play function 中的键盘测试</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Storybook 组件文档化","id":"storybook-组件文档化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Component Story Format（CSF 3）","id":"component-story-format-csf-3"},{"level":2,"text":"Autodocs 自动文档生成","id":"autodocs-自动文档生成"},{"level":2,"text":"MDX 深度文档","id":"mdx-深度文档"},{"level":2,"text":"Storybook 与 CI 的集成","id":"storybook-与-ci-的集成"},{"level":2,"text":"Interaction Testing 与 Play Functions","id":"interaction-testing-与-play-functions"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"代码分发与 Registry 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems/patterns/code-distribution-registry"},"next":{"title":"组件视觉与行为测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems/patterns/component-testing"}}